  "name": "p-transaction-that-is-not-well-formed",
  "note": "What is not a transaction is refused as one, before anything else about it is looked at. A branch with no name, a name with an empty or a dot component, a ref named twice, and a deletion of a ref expected to be absent are all refused as invalid: for a Contributor, for a stranger (k3) who would otherwise be refused as unauthorized, and alongside an update that would otherwise be stale. A name with several components is a name.",
